libddwaf
------------------------------------------
libddwaf is Datadog's implementation of a Web Application Firewall (WAF)
engine, with a goal of low performance and memory overhead, and embeddability
in a wide variety of language runtimes through a C API.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libddwaf-devel-2.1.0-1bl1
  libddwaf2-2.1.0-1bl1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libiconv2-1.19-2
  libintl8-0.22.5-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.11-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  git-2.51.0-1
  libgmock-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libgtest-devel-1.18.0-1bl1
  libiconv-devel-1.19-2
  libintl-devel-0.22.5-1
  libyaml-cpp-devel-0.9.0-1bl2
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/DataDog/libddwaf

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/DataDog/libddwaf/archive/refs/tags/2.1.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libddwaf-2.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libddwaf-2.1.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libddwaf-2.1.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libddwaf-2.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libddwaf2-2.1.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libddwaf-devel-2.1.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libddwaf)
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libddwaf.README
  /usr/share/doc/libddwaf/CONTRIBUTING.md
  /usr/share/doc/libddwaf/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/libddwaf/NOTICE
  /usr/share/doc/libddwaf/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/libddwaf/UPGRADING.md

(libddwaf2)
  /usr/bin/cygddwaf-2.dll

(libddwaf-devel)
  /usr/include/ddwaf.h
  /usr/lib/cmake/libddwaf/libddwaf-config-relwithdebinfo.cmake
  /usr/lib/cmake/libddwaf/libddwaf-config.cmake
  /usr/lib/libddwaf.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libddwaf.pc

